{"id":"17a74ce95d3d6e78","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-affine.md","title":"Affine Boolean function in the book convention","display":"df-affine — Affine Boolean function in the book convention","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-affine","aliases":["27-df-affine"],"display":"df-affine — Affine Boolean function in the book convention","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§2.10.3","source_statement":"Affine Boolean function and Equation (2.37)","source_printed_pages":"110","source_pdf_pages":"134","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-affine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-affine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-affine — Affine Boolean function in the book convention"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.10.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Affine Boolean function and Equation (2.37)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"110"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"134"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>）。整数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bmod2\">\\(\\bmod2\\)</span> 取值在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B\">\\(\\mathbb B\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AffineFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\middle|\\;\\exists\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)\\times\\mathbb B\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(f(x)=0\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall(A,b)\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\left(\\left(\\sum_{i\\in A}x_i\\right)\\bmod2=b\\right)\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{AffineFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\middle|\\;\\exists\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)\\times\\mathbb B\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(f(x)=0\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall(A,b)\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\left(\\left(\\sum_{i\\in A}x_i\\right)\\bmod2=b\\right)\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\oplus_n y\\coloneqq\\left((x_i+y_i)\\bmod2\\right)_{i\\in N}\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\oplus_n y\\coloneqq\\left((x_i+y_i)\\bmod2\\right)_{i\\in N}\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>严格采用原书 §2.10.3、(2.37)：FALSE 点是 GF(2) 线性方程组的解集。空系统给 f=0，方程 0=1 给 f=1；其他非空解集是线性子空间的平移。此处 affine function 不等同于输出恰为一个 GF(2) 仿射线性式的 Boolean function。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$（see [[27-df-boolfunc]]）。整数的 $\\bmod2$ 取值在 $\\mathbb B$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\bmod2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AffineFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\middle|\\;\\exists\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)\\times\\mathbb B\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(f(x)=0\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall(A,b)\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\left(\\left(\\sum_{i\\in A}x_i\\right)\\bmod2=b\\right)\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"x\\oplus_n y\\coloneqq\\left((x_i+y_i)\\bmod2\\right)_{i\\in N}\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true}],"bytes":1626,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-affine|df-affine — Affine Boolean function in the book convention]]"},{"id":"fc13515b6202f2b3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{AffineFunc}_n$ 和坐标 xor $\\oplus_n$（see [[27-df-affine]]）。"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817"]}